**Conducta:** RCP + epinefrina + causas reversibles; no desfibrilar rutinariamente.', 81)
ON CONFLICT (lesson_id, section_key) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.lesson_sections (id, lesson_id, section_key, title, body, sort_order)
VALUES ('22c16a73-0275-538f-8cfe-03c9f9db39c5', 'c2fbc835-1110-52d9-ac9f-3b1624b17f99', 'sec_82', 'Caso 6 — RCP', 'Compresiones a 70/min y superficiales.

**Problema:** calidad insuficiente; objetivo adulto 100–120/min y ≥5 cm evitando >6 cm.', 82)
ON CONFLICT (lesson_id, section_key) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.lesson_sections (id, lesson_id, section_key, title, body, sort_order)
